  "restoran": {
    "tentang": "Kurnia Seafood offers the finest selection of Fresh & Live Seafood, from lobster and fish to crab and shrimp. With more than 25 preparation choices, every dish can be enjoyed through a variety of cooking techniques — grilled, fried, and steamed sauces that are signature to Kurnia Seafood, including the rich and distinctive Saus Kurnia, the uniquely savory-sweet Saus Garlic Caramel, to the bold and appetizing Saus Padang. We provide comfort for every guest, whether dining with family or hosting various events, with complete facilities and a warm atmosphere. Halal certified, Kurnia Seafood is committed to serving seafood that is safe, high-quality, and enjoyable for everyone.",
    "fasilitas": [
      "Dining Room Area (Indoor & Outdoor)",
      "VIP Room Karaoke (Anyer, Carita)",
      "VIP Room Bunaken",
      "Mini Playground",
      "Prayer Room",
      "Lift/Elevator",
      "Spacious Parking"
    ],
